INT. HOTEL BALLROOM - STACKED CHAIRS AFTER A CONFERENCE - NIGHT

Chairs stacked in towers. A banner reading SYNERGY SUMMIT sags from one corner. Two coffee urns, empty. One man, one woman, one table.

MARGUERITE DELACROIX-OYELARAN, 50s, VP of Culture. Reading glasses on a chain. THADDEUS BECK, 30s, regional trainer, name tag still on. She sits. He stands.

MARGUERITE
Sit, Thaddeus.

THADDEUS
I'd rather stand.

MARGUERITE
That's what people say before they're fired.

THADDEUS
Am I being fired?

MARGUERITE
No. You're being promoted. Which is worse.

THADDEUS
Okay.

MARGUERITE
You'll lead the new Innovation Pod. Eight people. No budget.

THADDEUS
That's not a promotion.

MARGUERITE
It has a title.

THADDEUS
What title?

MARGUERITE
Chief Pod Officer.

THADDEUS
That's a joke.

MARGUERITE
It's on the org chart. I printed it.

THADDEUS
Marguerite.

MARGUERITE
I know.

THADDEUS
Last month you cut my team in half. You said "lean."

MARGUERITE
It was lean.

THADDEUS
You said "family."

MARGUERITE
We are a family.

THADDEUS
Families don't send a calendar invite for a funeral.

MARGUERITE
Thaddeus.

THADDEUS
They sent me an invite. For my own mentor's funeral. Titled "Farewell Sync."

MARGUERITE
That was an unfortunate template.

THADDEUS
It had a Zoom link.

MARGUERITE
Lower your voice.

THADDEUS
The room is empty!

MARGUERITE
The walls are not.

THADDEUS
I trained four hundred people today. About "psychological safety." Four hundred. I held their hands.

MARGUERITE
And they loved you.

THADDEUS
They're also being laid off.

MARGUERITE
You knew that.

THADDEUS
I found out at lunch. From a vending machine receipt. Somebody's severance code was on it.

MARGUERITE
That's an IT problem.

THADDEUS
No. That's a me problem. I smiled at them. I handed out lanyards. With their termination dates printed on the back.

MARGUERITE
(quietly)
Thaddeus.

THADDEUS
I'm done. Chief Pod Officer. I'm done.

MARGUERITE
You can't quit. You haven't vested.

THADDEUS
Watch me.

He rips off his name tag and slaps it on the table. She stares at it a long moment.

MARGUERITE
That's a two-hundred-dollar badge.

THADDEUS
Put it on the budget I don't have.
